// #53: a zero window stops us; window probes (seq snd_una - 1) go out on the
// persist timer with backoff, and data flows once the window opens
// (tcp_probe_timer, tcp_send_probe0, tcp_write_wakeup, tcp_ack_probe). The
// base is the RTO: 10 ms RTT gives 10 ms + 200 ms.
0      connect 192.0.2.2:80
+0     > S 0:0(0) <mss 1460,sackOK,nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 0,nop,wscale 8,eol>
+0.01  < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535

+0.01  < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 0
+0     send 1000
+0.21  > . 0:0(0) ack 1
+0.01  < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 0
+0.42  > . 0:0(0) ack 1
+0.01  < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 4000
+0     > P. 1:1001(1000) ack 1
+0     status 1
